    "min": 10,
    "max": 60
  },
  "scenario": {
    "zh": "60 级以猎豹形态打近战输出",
    "en": "Level 60 melee damage in Cat Form"
  },
  "pros": [
    {
      "zh": "锋利兽爪、自然本能与血之狂暴把暴击转化为额外连击点和更高的暴击伤害。",
      "en": "Sharpened Claws, Natural Instinct, and Blood Frenzy build critical strikes into extra combo points and bigger crits."
    },
    {
      "zh": "Shifting Power 随时把法力转成 40 点能量，Improved Shifting Power 让它的冷却减半；撕碎攻击让撕碎的能量消耗降低 18 点。",
      "en": "Shifting Power turns Mana into 40 Energy on demand and Improved Shifting Power halves its cooldown; Shredding Attacks cuts the cost of Shred by 18."
    },
    {
      "zh": "狂乱撕扯对流血目标提高 10% 伤害，保持扫击和撕扯的效果。",
      "en": "Rend and Tear adds 10% damage against bleeding targets, so keep Rake and Rip up."
    },
    {
      "zh": "激怒让你变回猎豹形态时找回能量，自然主义让所有伤害提高 5%。",
      "en": "Furor returns your Cat Form energy when you shift back, and Naturalist adds 5% to all damage."
    },
    {
      "zh": "单刷或 PvP？把自然主义的点数换成厚皮与野蛮冲撞，换取护甲和更长的重击昏迷。",
      "en": "Solo play or PvP? Move Naturalist points into Thick Hide and Brutal Impact for more armor and a longer Bash."
    }
  ],
